# 28. Error and Unknown Handling

Early Radar should explicitly support uncertainty.

Examples:

```text
Language = Unknown
Client = Undisclosed
Hiring outcome = Unknown
Publication date = Unknown
```

Unknown information should remain unknown.

The system must not fill gaps through assumptions.

---

# 29. Evidence and Provenance

Every important finding should retain its source.

Conceptually:

```text
Finding
   │
   ├── Source URL
   ├── Source type
   ├── Published date
   ├── Detection date
   └── Supporting information
```

This allows the user to inspect the evidence behind an Early Radar result.

